<title>UK: Old English Pub expands pubs business.</title>
<headline>Old English Pub expands pubs business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Old English Pub Cpmpany Plc said on Wednesday that it had agreed to buy four pubs and Country Style Inns Ltd from Glenchewton Plc for a maximum 10.75 million stg.</p>
</text>
